<title>JAPAN: Kosugi Sangyo - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Kosugi Sangyo - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to July 31, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 30.25		vs	   29.25</p>
<p> Operating   loss 368    million    vs     loss 1.15</p>
<p> Current     loss 383    million    vs     loss 1.16</p>
<p> Net	   loss 370    million    vs     loss 1.13</p>
<p> EPS	    loss 13.46 yen	  vs    loss 41.13 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     28 million	  vs	  28 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Kosugi Sangyo Co Ltd is a major maker and wholesaler of apparels, dealing primarily in knitwear.</p>
